Where it is used:
  - data/results/mlcq_dataset.csv, in this repository and in the Docker image.
  - The machine-learning models in the Docker image, which are trained on that file.

Changes made to the original data:
  - Reviews were aggregated per sample and smell (mean, maximum, minimum, unanimity).
  - Samples whose source could not be located in the referenced repository were dropped.
  - Metrics computed by this tool were added as new columns.

